SUMMARY:NIH Summer Internship Program (SIP) (Engineering) due
DESCRIPTION:https://www.training.nih.gov/research-training/pb/sip/\nU.S. citizen or permanent resident\; must be 18 by September 30\, 2027\; must be enrolled at least half-time as a high school senior at time of application AND have graduated before internship starts (May 10\, 2027). If turning 18 between June 1 and September 30\, 2027\, permanent home must be within 40 miles of an NIH campus.
URL:https://www.training.nih.gov/research-training/pb/sip/
