DESCRIPTION:https://www.austintexas.gov/economic-development/programs/high-school-internship-opportunities\nMust be a resident of Austin\, Texas and attend an Austin-area high school. Must be a rising sophomore\, junior\, senior or current senior. Must be between the ages of 15 and 18 years old at the time you apply. Must be available for the full duration of the program with no more than 3 days of absences.
